  <diagram name="Legend" id="legend">
    <mxGraphModel dx="964" dy="733" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="650" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="legend-title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=light-dark(#010000,#FFF9F9);" value="LEGEND" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="1400" x="20" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-t0" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=light-dark(#010000,#FFF9F9);" value="&lt;b&gt;Symbols&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Oval: start, end, or jump to another page. Parallelogram: input, output, or message. Rectangle: process. Diamond: decision (Yes and No are required). Dashed rounded box: rule or note. Arrow: forward step or return." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="1500" x="20" y="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-t1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=light-dark(#010000,#FFF9F9);" value="&lt;b&gt;Colors&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;White: step kept from v1. Yellow: same step, behavior or wording changed in v2. Green: added in v2 to fix a review finding or to match the new product decisions." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="1500" x="20" y="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-t2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=light-dark(#010000,#FFF9F9);" value="&lt;b&gt;Product decisions behind v2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Personal tracker: every account owns its own semesters, subjects and scores. No instructor or student roles.&lt;br&gt;2. A subject is created by PDF upload, manual entry, or the Add Subject button (under Grade Calculator). All open the same dialog and the same form.&lt;br&gt;3. Syllabus data is private to the account. Sharing happens outside the app as a PDF copy. The uploaded PDF is parsed, then discarded.&lt;br&gt;4. Students enter a raw score and a max score for each activity. Results are an estimate (self-reported), never an official grade.&lt;br&gt;5. Responsive web app for 500+ users, designed to reach 5,000. All dates use Asia/Manila." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="1500" x="20" y="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-t3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=light-dark(#010000,#FFF9F9);" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading the flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Page 1 Authentication, Page 2 Dashboard and Add Subject, Page 3 Subject Modules, Page 4 Grade Calculator. Ovals named TO PAGE n and FROM PAGE n connect the pages. The full build rules (data model, API, limits, tests, milestones) are in the document GoldenSync - Build Specification v2. This diagram and that document must stay in agreement." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="1500" x="20" y="480" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="Change Log" id="changelog">
    <mxGraphModel dx="833" dy="633" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="850" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="changelog-title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=light-dark(#010000,#EEEDED);" value="CHANGE LOG" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="1400" x="20" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="changelog-t0" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=light-dark(#010000,#EEEDED);" value="&lt;b&gt;Version 2 - 2026-11-10 - rebuilt from the review of v1 and the answers to the three review questions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Added&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Registration consent and email verification. Forgot and reset password. Login throttling and dummy hash check. Server-side sessions checked on every request (idle 30 min, absolute 12 h). Semesters with start date, end date and skipped weeks. Add Subject button under Grade Calculator. PDF queue, scanned-PDF check, sandboxed worker, size and page limits. Shared subject form with flagged fields and autosaved drafts. Idempotency key and one-transaction save. Replace with archive and score copy. Per-activity score and max entry, add activity, version conflict handling. Five fixed grade statuses and a grade-scale gate. Planner states (before start, no class, after end, no plan). Edit, archive, delete subject. Account export and delete.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Changed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dashboard no longer branches on instructor or student. Syllabus is private per account. Duplicate check is per semester by course code (so a retake is allowed) and is enforced by a unique index. Scores are entered per activity, and outcome percents are computed (before: one typed number per outcome). Results are derived from stored raw scores (before: only the grade was stored). Modules render from the saved subject (before: ITE 14 sample text). Navigation is a sidebar (before: a chain of Yes/No questions). Logout and idle expiry are global rules (before: one decision at the end).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Removed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Instructor-only upload gate and the deny-sync step. Overwrite of another record in place. The unreachable No rule matched branch. Stale statements that arrows were not drawn.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Not changed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;10 MB PDF limit. Fail-closed save in one transaction. Preview before save. Ordered grade tests and the 60 percent thresholds. Ticks never change a result." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="330" width="1500" x="20" y="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="changelog-t1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=light-dark(#010000,#EEEDED);" value="&lt;b&gt;Review findings resolved&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;E1 roles: removed, ownership only. E2 score ownership: scores belong to the subject, the subject to one user. E3 order: Grade Calculator lives inside a subject. E4 overwrite: Replace archives and copies scores. E5 average = 60: UNDEFINED_AT_THRESHOLD. E6 mapping and states: grade scale table plus five statuses. E7 only grade stored: raw scores stored, result derived. E8 idle: global server check. E9 navigation: sidebar. E10 hardcoded ITE 14: modules render from the subject. E11 dead branch: removed. E12 stale text: rewritten.&lt;br&gt;B1 duplicate race: unique index and idempotency key. B2 enumeration: identical responses. B3 email tricks: strict parse and exact domain. B4 zero outcomes: form requires at least 1 outcome and 1 mapped activity. B5 decimals: Decimal math. B6 scanned PDF: 200 character check. B7 incomplete rows: flagged, never dropped. B8 lost edits: shared prefilled form and drafts. B9 planner edges: four explicit states.&lt;br&gt;R1 authorization: every query scoped by user. R2 auth hardening: throttling, argon2id, verification, reset. R3 PDF: sandboxed worker with limits. R4 output injection: escaped output, CSV neutralized. R5 session: server-side revoke. R6 privacy: consent, export, delete. R7 audit log. R8 constants in one config. R9 scale: queue and bounded lists." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="1500" x="20" y="440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="changelog-t2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=light-dark(#010000,#EEEDED);" value="&lt;b&gt;Still open (see Build Specification section 17)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;D1 official average-to-grade table (numeric PASSED grade stays hidden until confirmed). D2 how activities roll up into an outcome (default: points-weighted). D3 INTERVENTION_A grade (default: mapped average). D4 rule when the average is exactly 60. D5 allowed email domains. D6 hosting and email provider. D7 at least 5 real F-CID-009 PDFs for parser tests." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="1500" x="20" y="680" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="Data and Routes" id="routes">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1665" dy="1265" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="830" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="routes-title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=light-dark(#010000,#EEEDED);" value="DATA AND ROUTES" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="1400" x="20" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="routes-t0" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=light-dark(#010000,#EEEDED);" value="&lt;b&gt;Routes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Screen | Route | Sidebar label | Data&lt;br&gt;Login | /login | - | email, password&lt;br&gt;Registration | /register | - | email, password, confirm, consent&lt;br&gt;Verify email | /verify-email?token | - | token&lt;br&gt;Forgot / reset password | /forgot-password, /reset-password?token | - | email, token, new password&lt;br&gt;Dashboard | /dashboard | Home | semesters, subject cards&lt;br&gt;Semester | /semesters/new, /semesters/:id | Home | label, start, end, skipped weeks&lt;br&gt;Add Subject | /subjects/new | Add Subject | PDF file or form data&lt;br&gt;Overview | /subjects/:id/overview | Overview | course specification&lt;br&gt;Outcomes | /subjects/:id/outcomes | Outcomes | PEO / PO / CO, I-E-D map&lt;br&gt;Learning plan | /subjects/:id/plan | Learning Plan and Notes | plan weeks, own notes&lt;br&gt;Grading, policies, faculty | /subjects/:id/grading, /policies, /faculty | Grading, Class Policies, College Faculty | syllabus parts&lt;br&gt;This Week | /subjects/:id/week | This Week | plan weeks, semester dates&lt;br&gt;Checklist | /subjects/:id/checklist | Checklist | checklist_items&lt;br&gt;Assessment map | /subjects/:id/assessments | Assessment Map | activities, outcome mapping&lt;br&gt;Grade Calculator | /subjects/:id/calculator | Grade Calculator | activities, scores&lt;br&gt;Export | /subjects/:id/export | Export | own subject only" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="330" width="1500" x="20" y="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="routes-t1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=light-dark(#010000,#EEEDED);" value="&lt;b&gt;Data model (all keyed by owner)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;users, auth_tokens, sessions, semesters (user) &gt; subjects (semester, unique active course code per semester) &gt; course_outcomes, plan_weeks, assessments, assessment_outcomes, scores (one raw score per activity, versioned), checklist_items. Support tables: ingest_jobs, drafts, idempotency_keys, grade_scale and grade_scale_meta, audit_log (insert-only). Deleting a parent cascades. Full SQL is in the Build Specification section 5." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="1500" x="20" y="440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="routes-t2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=light-dark(#010000,#EEEDED);" value="&lt;b&gt;API summary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Auth: register, verify, resend-verification, login, logout, forgot-password, reset-password. Account: GET and DELETE /api/me, GET /api/me/export. Semesters: list, create, update, delete. Subjects: POST /api/subjects (Idempotency-Key), POST /api/subjects/ingest (202), GET and POST confirm on /api/subjects/ingest/:jobId, GET PATCH DELETE /api/subjects/:id, POST /api/subjects/:id/replace. Activities and scores: POST /api/subjects/:id/assessments, PATCH DELETE /api/assessments/:id, PUT /api/subjects/:id/scores. Derived: GET /api/subjects/:id/outcome, GET /api/subjects/:id/week. Other: PUT checklist, GET export, PUT /api/drafts/:kind. Another account&#39;s ids always return 404." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="1500" x="20" y="540" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="routes-t3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=light-dark(#010000,#EEEDED);" value="&lt;b&gt;Key limits (one config file)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;10 MB PDF, 60 pages, 200 characters minimum extracted text, 20 s parse timeout, 10 uploads per hour, 5 login failures per 15 min, session idle 30 min and absolute 12 h, 20 subjects per semester, 30 semesters, 20 outcomes, 150 activities, 30 weeks, thresholds 60 and 60, time zone Asia/Manila." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="1500" x="20" y="680" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
